[scene format=1]

; The metal backdrop (src/worlds.c builds the hall, its columns, beams and fluted far wall, its environment map, and
; sweeps the lights): a hall of brushed and polished metal, a floor of brushed steel plates, chrome columns ringed in
; gold down both sides, gunmetal beams overhead, slow lights sweeping across it all in time with the music.

